{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">謝賢離世｜謝賢（四哥）日前離世，享年89歲，演藝界後輩紛紛發文表達沉痛悼念。曾與四哥合作無綫劇集《賭城群英會》的視后佘詩曼，於社交平台上載昔日合作片段，追憶這位演藝界傳奇人物。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">佘詩曼感性表示，能夠與四哥合作是極大的榮幸，並大讚對方是一位非常值得學習的前輩：「十分敬業，願意同後輩分享佢嘅經驗、對自己要求高、但又風趣幽默、勁有風度。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1144752f-fe44-4997-bbfd-0465e3b0d410.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026G4axmaIQN81784622772.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1144752f-fe44-4997-bbfd-0465e3b0d410.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"308deaf1-560f-4263-a072-1d34a6bd9fb3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026j8JmYLCddr1784622777.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"308deaf1-560f-4263-a072-1d34a6bd9fb3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">回憶起當年合作《賭城群英會》的點滴，佘詩曼透露私下的四哥毫無巨星架子，和大家完全打成一片：「我同佢講笑話點樣可以成為千王之王，佢即刻叫我攞副啤牌嚟，話要教返我幾下功夫，我記得佢話：『最緊要擺post有型！』」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">除了在拍攝現場傾囊相授，四哥亦展現出細心溫柔的一面。佘詩曼透露，在她煞科當天，四哥竟特意為她準備了一大束鮮花，令她深受感動，大讚四哥是名副其實的「暖男」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T08:58:15.851530+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}